Orion Worktree Report

The overlap and unordered-pair deduplication concepts acknowledge ECC by
Affaan Mustafa: https://github.com/affaan-m/ECC
Reference: v2.0.0, commit 8ad4151095e453301ce0e50374103bcd8f50ded2,
ecc2/src/session/store.rs (list_file_overlaps) and
ecc2/src/session/manager.rs (conflict_incident_key).

The reporter uses registered Git worktrees and exact dirty-path bytes rather
than ECC's session database. It replaces activity ranking, incident state and
delimiter keys with a coverage report and domain-framed identifiers. This
acknowledgment does not claim endorsement or an exact historical source pin.
